                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                    %mo −
                    %msup
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mo †
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (-\vert-)^\dagger
              is the coevaluation map.
